01:10:23,050 --> 01:10:24,482
They do not work at all.

1119
01:10:24,562 --> 01:10:26,873
My case lingered for four years.

1120
01:10:26,953 --> 01:10:30,376
Those were horrible times when I had to go to the court.

1121
01:10:30,456 --> 01:10:34,336
The lawyer kept dawdling it just to see a young, beautiful, weak,

1122
01:10:34,416 --> 01:10:38,914
no man around and what not lady coming to his chamber or seeking his help.

1123
01:10:38,994 --> 01:10:42,995
But less he knew that I was not weak, nor I needed his help.

1124
01:10:43,075 --> 01:10:46,080
After wasting all those years, I changed my lawyer.

1125
01:10:46,160 --> 01:10:48,408
and asked him to finalize the things.

1126
01:10:48,488 --> 01:10:54,249
I did not need any money but peace of my mind and my daughter's documentation in my hand.

1127
01:10:54,329 --> 01:10:57,682
In February 2021 we did our out of court settlement.

1128
01:10:57,762 --> 01:11:02,474
I agreed that only available dowry items will be recovered from them.

1129
01:11:02,554 --> 01:11:06,724
There would be no dowry gold, no child maintenance, no haq meher.

1130
01:11:06,804 --> 01:11:08,377
Look, he left everything.

1131
01:11:08,457 --> 01:11:13,640
According to Pakistan law, you get a portion of haq meher in case of Khulha.

1132
01:11:13,800 --> 01:11:16,880
In return of that, I got my daughter's custody in my hand.

1133
01:11:16,960 --> 01:11:22,320
I was criticized a lot for doing all these decisions alone without asking any chacha-phoppa help.

1134
01:11:22,400 --> 01:11:27,120
All these years, there came some marriage proposals for me.

1135
01:11:27,200 --> 01:11:32,080
The worst one was aged 50 plus with kids not too younger than me.

1136
01:11:32,160 --> 01:11:36,195
My aim was to get financially independent, settling my family, get any siblings,

1137
01:11:36,275 --> 01:11:39,520
get my siblings education done and marry when I feel like marrying.

1138
01:11:39,600 --> 01:11:41,580
Not because I'm getting old or my daughter needs me.

1139
01:11:41,660 --> 01:11:42,835
daughter needs a father.

1140
01:11:42,915 --> 01:11:44,222
I know she needed though.

1141
01:11:44,302 --> 01:11:47,231
I met this amazing guy when I was working alongside him.

1142
01:11:47,311 --> 01:11:53,589
We developed a good understanding and he seemed to be the one who is not afraid of career oriented women by his side.

1143
01:11:53,669 --> 01:11:58,089
And the other factor is not every man is okay with his wife spending on her family.

1144
01:11:58,169 --> 01:11:58,953
In our society,

1145
01:11:59,033 --> 01:12:04,370
you would hardly see a man who has no insecurities from a strong and financially independent woman,

1146
01:12:04,450 --> 01:12:06,096
especially in the form of spouse.

1147
01:12:06,176 --> 01:12:09,310
Once I was sure that I arranged my daughter's meet up with him.

1148
01:12:09,390 --> 01:12:14,350
This marriage was solely my decision. It was his first marriage, so lots of hurdles around for him.

1149
01:12:14,430 --> 01:12:20,910
He belongs to a conservative family and his caste system, dowry with car is a necessary thing. What the hell.

1150
01:12:21,140 --> 01:12:25,141
But he is the odd one out, so settled our home on its own.

1151
01:12:25,221 --> 01:12:30,990
His job was in Lahore, so he used to live there and his family in another city.

1152
01:12:31,070 --> 01:12:35,730
After we got married, the family was so nice to me and my daughter. Alhamdulillah, we got blessed with another daughter.

1153
01:12:35,810 --> 01:12:41,290
daughter in March 2022. Fun fact, my both daughters born on the same date with different years. Wow.

1154
01:12:41,370 --> 01:12:43,297
Ek hi cake mein dono bachche farekh.

1155
01:12:43,377 --> 01:12:44,073
Kya baat hai.

1156
01:12:44,153 --> 01:12:46,616
Later in 2022, I was offered a job in England.

1157
01:12:46,696 --> 01:12:50,202
They sponsored me with my family with a good relocation package.

1158
01:12:50,282 --> 01:12:51,459
So we moved to the UK.

1159
01:12:51,539 --> 01:12:53,788
My husband found his field job soon after.

1160
01:12:53,868 --> 01:12:57,856
He is working in a well-reputed company here and doing great in his role.

1161
01:12:57,936 --> 01:13:02,540
Regarding my family, both my younger sisters completed their four years degree last year.

1162
01:13:02,620 --> 01:13:09,460
Last year, one got married recently. One is Nikafied and waiting for her USA visa.

1163
01:13:09,540 --> 01:13:12,540
And in the meantime, doing a job in Lahore as an interior designer.

1164
01:13:12,620 --> 01:13:16,540
My brother is doing a degree in computer sciences. Younger sister is in college.

1165
01:13:16,620 --> 01:13:22,540
Other than anything in my life, I feel proud for being able to get my siblings educated.

1166
01:13:22,620 --> 01:13:25,540
I managed all the finances back home for my family.

1167
01:13:25,620 --> 01:13:29,940
As of me, I'm a happily married mother of two, working at a senior position.

1168
01:13:30,020 --> 01:13:31,815
in a renowned hospital of London.

1169
01:13:31,895 --> 01:13:34,419
I turned out to be a public speaker lately,

1170
01:13:34,499 --> 01:13:42,843
have been invited multiple times to speak on career opportunities of my field and career guidance seminars at various platforms like CMH Lahore,

1171
01:13:42,923 --> 01:13:46,242
Shah Al Amar Medical College in person and now virtually.

1172
01:13:46,322 --> 01:13:53,381
All these years I was visiting faculty in Shah Al Amar Medical College and University of Faisalabad for medical physics,

1173
01:13:53,461 --> 01:13:55,160
nuclear medicine and ultrasound.

1174
01:13:55,240 --> 01:13:57,428
Before coming to UK, I was an examiner,

1175
01:13:57,508 --> 01:14:01,091
paper assessor at University of Health and Sciences,

1176
01:14:01,171 --> 01:14:04,194
and was a member of their course revision committee.

1177
01:14:04,274 --> 01:14:06,367
My name is on their website as well.

1178
01:14:06,447 --> 01:14:06,747
Wow.

1179
01:14:06,827 --> 01:14:08,655
With all the experience that I had,

1180
01:14:08,735 --> 01:14:14,876
I started career counseling officially for medical aspirants at FSC level and allied health professionals.

1181
01:14:14,956 --> 01:14:18,097
For that, I have a newly built Insta page as well.

1182
01:14:18,177 --> 01:14:21,300
I'm affiliated with an institute in Peshawar, Pakistan.

1183
01:14:21,380 --> 01:14:23,705
for the student's career guidance.

1184
01:14:23,785 --> 01:14:27,203
Everything is handy on Teams or online these days.

1185
01:14:27,283 --> 01:14:32,286
Also, I'm general secretary of society of medical imaging technologists.

1186
01:14:32,366 --> 01:14:34,349
Everything in just six years.

1187
01:14:34,429 --> 01:14:35,033
Mashallah.

1188
01:14:35,113 --> 01:14:38,064
You can learn resilience, hope, hard work,

1189
01:14:38,144 --> 01:14:42,680
a lot from my life and I never believed on all men are the same.

1190
01:14:48,330 --> 01:14:50,656
I also write Urdu blogs.

1191
01:14:50,736 --> 01:14:56,050
If you want to read something, I write on our website.

1192
01:14:56,130 --> 01:15:07,050
I write on my book, Kalmi Naam, based on my experience.

1193
01:15:07,130 --> 01:15:10,050
I work in London but I don't live there.

1194
01:15:10,130 --> 01:15:12,050
My house is in the countryside.

1195
01:15:12,130 --> 01:15:15,940
As you said, if you like such places, then next time.

1196
01:15:16,020 --> 01:15:20,140
Next time you go to the UK, do give Dua a treat.

1197
01:15:20,220 --> 01:15:22,140
Author, Umm Nisa. So proud of you.

1198
01:15:22,220 --> 01:15:25,193
So as you heard this story, it's painful.

1199
01:15:25,273 --> 01:15:28,810
I won't say it started as that, but I handled it.

1200
01:15:29,560 --> 01:15:35,051
Now this is the reason why I always say that don't just teach your sons,

1201
01:15:35,131 --> 01:15:39,420
but also your daughters because they should have backup.

1202
01:15:41,610 --> 01:15:47,007
Again, the father's friend who had a lot of money,

1203
01:15:47,087 --> 01:15:52,990
said that he will take the daughter and blackmail her.

1204
01:15:53,070 --> 01:15:55,290
And then the same thing happened. He asked for 10-20 lakhs.

1205
01:15:55,370 --> 01:16:01,790
And then later, at home, you heard that his own brother-in-law used to harass him.

1206
01:16:01,870 --> 01:16:06,410
And then he was accused of seducing him.

1207
01:16:06,590 --> 01:16:12,910
The point being that when you are financially independent, this is the reason.

1208
01:16:12,990 --> 01:16:17,110
Now people say that the ratio of divorce is increasing because of educated women.

1209
01:16:17,190 --> 01:16:24,310
So, people who say this want that such women, who are imaging technologists,

1210
01:16:24,390 --> 01:16:30,310
should just live with a B-Com fail man who is a drug dealer.

1211
01:16:30,390 --> 01:16:32,390
And live with him for the rest of their lives.

1212
01:16:34,260 --> 01:16:39,492
They are harassed, their in-laws are taunted, and they say that our sanctity,

1213
01:16:39,572 --> 01:16:43,760
our society's fabric should not break, so they should not divorce.

1214
01:16:43,840 --> 01:16:47,856
These people, these disgusting people who say that the divorce rate is increasing,

1215
01:16:47,936 --> 01:16:51,520
or that educated women are dangerous for society, this is what they want.

1216
01:16:51,600 --> 01:16:55,300
And they will never want this for their sister, they will never want this for their mother either.

1217
01:16:55,380 --> 01:17:01,120
But they will want this for your sisters that they should just keep their heads down and endure.

1218
01:17:01,310 --> 01:17:11,370
They don't want to let you do the work, but they want you to get the money.

1219
01:17:11,450 --> 01:17:14,570
So this is the benefit of educating your daughter and saving her life.

1220
01:17:14,650 --> 01:17:17,610
Otherwise, this life would have ended a long time ago.

1221
01:17:17,690 --> 01:17:21,250
She might not be able to sustain for 6 years.

1222
01:17:21,330 --> 01:17:28,100
And then the same thing, if she hadn't studied for 6 years, she would have been able to sustain for 6 years.

1223
01:17:28,390 --> 01:17:33,390
And if the father is not alive, then who would take care of him?

1224
01:17:33,470 --> 01:17:38,312
Then society gives a woman who has no man behind her,

1225
01:17:38,392 --> 01:17:42,270
a walking stick which she wants to scratch.

1226
01:17:42,350 --> 01:17:49,070
But it is education that secures you, that keeps you on your feet, that keeps your shoulders straight, that keeps your head straight.

1227
01:17:49,150 --> 01:17:51,150
Only then can you do something in life.

1228
01:17:54,860 --> 01:18:03,540
I am very happy to hear such success stories.

1229
01:18:03,620 --> 01:18:08,020
Now there are fuckups in life, nobody sees that through.

1230
01:18:08,100 --> 01:18:12,280
Nobody willfully wants to get their daughter married to a drug dealer.

1231
01:18:12,360 --> 01:18:14,280
But please, this friendship is coming.

1232
01:18:14,360 --> 01:18:16,280
The friends who are there, they are the ones who betray you.

1233
01:18:16,360 --> 01:18:20,780
Because they have an idea of your pocket, your matters, your home.

1234
01:18:20,860 --> 01:18:22,340
So mostly it comes from here.

1235
01:18:22,420 --> 01:18:29,260
So be very very wary of the fact that just because they are not there, they will not do this.

1236
01:18:29,340 --> 01:18:31,260
So that is the biggest deception.

1237
01:18:31,340 --> 01:18:36,260
And good on you that you took a stand.

1238
01:18:36,340 --> 01:18:40,260
Now this is about the court, as you said that the lawyer was also annoying.

1239
01:18:40,340 --> 01:18:45,260
Here it is the same that the girl kept coming in the room and they kept putting up a lot of people every day.

1240
01:18:45,340 --> 01:18:47,760
Sometimes someone is coming, sometimes someone is coming and all that.

1241
01:18:47,840 --> 01:18:50,190
The same thing, everyone knows that there is no one ahead or behind.

1242
01:18:50,270 --> 01:18:52,190
So just clean your hands.

1243
01:18:52,270 --> 01:18:56,190
This is your resilience that you didn't give up.

1244
01:18:56,270 --> 01:19:01,190
And this thing about divorce where you gave up things, only so that you can have custody.

1245
01:19:01,270 --> 01:19:05,190
See, the money that went to the dowry was worth 10 lakhs.

1246
01:19:05,270 --> 01:19:08,190
The other thing is the amount of the dowry.

1247
01:19:08,270 --> 01:19:10,190
You can spend a million which won't happen.

1248
01:19:10,270 --> 01:19:14,270
So you will earn in this year and make it straight.

1249
01:19:16,660 --> 01:19:22,900
The carefree girl who is now in your custody, she lives with you outside.

1250
01:19:22,980 --> 01:19:28,100
This is priceless.

1251
01:19:28,180 --> 01:19:34,260
You cannot put a price on this. Because she gave up custody, no one will bother you.

1252
01:19:34,340 --> 01:19:40,100
And you will be happy, and I am very happy that you did not weigh this with money.

1253
01:19:40,180 --> 01:19:44,090
You chose peace and you should always choose peace.

1254
01:19:44,170 --> 01:19:49,210
Money will come again as long as you are healthy and have the right mindset.

1255
01:19:49,290 --> 01:19:51,890
Allah has given us the strength. Money will come again.

1256
01:19:51,970 --> 01:19:55,350
Never let these relationships be traded.

1257
01:19:55,430 --> 01:19:56,850
You have done a great job.

1258
01:19:56,930 --> 01:19:59,230
Secondly, your other husband.

1259
01:19:59,310 --> 01:20:05,810
A secure man is the one who doesn't have a problem.

1260
01:20:05,890 --> 01:20:11,110
Otherwise we see that the insecure man is happy to get rid of everyone.

1261
01:20:11,190 --> 01:20:11,990
He fights with his sisters.

1262
01:20:12,070 --> 01:20:15,668
fight with your brothers, fight with your parents, leave home,

1263
01:20:15,748 --> 01:20:20,230
so that he is completely alone and then I will be left to my own devices.

1264
01:20:20,310 --> 01:20:26,790
There is no one for this now. So a secure person does not have this tension that whatever you are earning is being invested in this house or that house.

1265
01:20:26,870 --> 01:20:32,290
He says that we have to build a house together and we have to live in peace and security.

1266
01:20:32,370 --> 01:20:36,130
So as long as peace exists in this house, I do not care. I will earn my own money.

1267
01:20:36,210 --> 01:20:39,700
You think that you have to teach your siblings, take care of your mother.

1268
01:20:39,780 --> 01:20:40,700
You should definitely do it.

1269
01:20:40,780 --> 01:20:42,700
It is a sign of a secure man.

1270
01:20:42,780 --> 01:20:46,268
And this is the reward that because of you,

1271
01:20:46,348 --> 01:20:50,700
they went abroad and they also got their field job.

1272
01:20:50,780 --> 01:20:55,700
Now, Mashallah, you are in a secure society and you will progress.

1273
01:20:55,780 --> 01:21:00,700
Your daughters will study there, write, become good citizens, get good education.

1274
01:21:00,780 --> 01:21:02,700
Universities are so much better there.

1275
01:21:02,780 --> 01:21:04,700
Mashallah, you have studied and written so much.

1276
01:21:04,780 --> 01:21:06,730
So I am sure education is something you will.

1277
01:21:06,810 --> 01:21:13,450
You will never compromise upon because this education is the weapon that brought you out of this battle.

1278
01:21:13,530 --> 01:21:21,490
Otherwise you would have been standing in that battlefield and everyone would have come and destroyed you and ruined your life.

1279
01:21:21,570 --> 01:21:25,930
So education was the only way that you were able to get out of this mess.

1280
01:21:26,010 --> 01:21:31,250
Not only from that marriage, not only from this society, but from all the tensions.

1281
01:21:31,330 --> 01:21:34,540
And not only you alone, but because of you all your sisters.

1282
01:21:34,620 --> 01:21:38,460
Your brother and your mother are living a peaceful life.

1283
01:21:38,540 --> 01:21:43,980
So if you educate a girl, so many people are positively impacted.

1284
01:21:44,060 --> 01:21:49,240
This is the benefit of education and financial independence.

1285
01:21:49,320 --> 01:21:51,740
You don't sit and suffer.

1286
01:21:51,820 --> 01:21:57,540
Your father-in-law is a drug dealer.

1287
01:21:57,620 --> 01:22:02,060
He can't fix his son and is telling him to sit at home.

1288
01:22:02,320 --> 01:22:03,520
And then he brought money.

1289
01:22:03,600 --> 01:22:08,640
They are the worst people. It's good that you left your country.

1290
01:22:08,720 --> 01:22:10,240
You left your life.

1291
01:22:10,320 --> 01:22:12,240
So Allah will ask them now.

1292
01:22:12,320 --> 01:22:16,840
So please, all those listening, never ever compromise on education.

1293
01:22:16,920 --> 01:22:18,640
Especially if it's a girl.

1294
01:22:18,720 --> 01:22:24,720
Because our society wants her to have no education, nor does she have anything to earn.

1295
01:22:24,800 --> 01:22:26,920
So that I don't make her dance to my tunes.

1296
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:28,440
And I don't make her do anything.

1297
01:22:28,520 --> 01:22:30,260
And make her a machine to have children.

1298
01:22:30,340 --> 01:22:33,227
They can't do anything.

1299
01:22:33,307 --> 01:22:37,027
They try to make them slaves.

1300
01:22:37,107 --> 01:22:40,880
Not all men, but mostly.

1301
01:22:40,960 --> 01:22:42,663
This is the power dynamics.

1302
01:22:42,743 --> 01:22:46,246
Because they have seen this happening in their homes,

1303
01:22:46,326 --> 01:22:48,660
they also try to prevail the culture.

1304
01:22:48,740 --> 01:22:53,600
It's not that education has nothing to do with education, it's just mentality.

1305
01:22:53,680 --> 01:22:56,900
You will find many educated people in the elite class.

1306
01:22:56,980 --> 01:22:58,433
who do financial abuse.

1307
01:22:58,513 --> 01:23:03,740
They may be millionaires or billionaires but they will take a $150 from you.

1308
01:23:03,820 --> 01:23:07,820
They don't even enable you to go out of the street. There are many people like that.

1309
01:23:07,900 --> 01:23:10,965
So it has nothing to do with economics,

1310
01:23:11,045 --> 01:23:16,100
it has only to do with mental capacity and your approach in life.

1311
01:23:16,180 --> 01:23:19,700
So this is the best weapon to get rid of such animals.

1312
01:23:19,780 --> 01:23:21,380
That you have education.

1313
01:23:21,460 --> 01:23:23,780
Try to...

1314
01:23:24,640 --> 01:23:30,280
But if you feel that you have reached a dead end and there is no way ahead of this lane and there are dogs and a lot of people,

1315
01:23:30,360 --> 01:23:35,338
Independence is very important financially so that you can get rid of such people.

1316
01:23:35,418 --> 01:23:38,360
then it is better to leave the lane.

1317
01:23:38,440 --> 01:23:46,440
So never ever compromise on education and allow them to have some say.

1318
01:23:51,880 --> 01:23:58,800
I am very happy to see your success and that you write as well.

1319
01:23:58,880 --> 01:24:04,800
One thing is that I came out of this. Another thing is that I want more people to come out of this.

1320
01:24:04,880 --> 01:24:10,800
I can make funny vlogs and make a good living. But this channel is solely for the same purpose.

1321
01:24:10,880 --> 01:24:15,800
Because I am sharing my experience with other people.

1322
01:24:15,880 --> 01:24:18,880
So this is what we are going through and others are not going through.

1323
01:24:19,810 --> 01:24:22,926
Allah gives you a soft heart and sensitivity.

1324
01:24:23,006 --> 01:24:28,290
This is a blessing because there is a lack of sensitivity in this country.

1325
01:24:28,370 --> 01:24:34,370
Whether it is for people, family, animals, or trees, people are not sensitive.

1326
01:24:34,450 --> 01:24:39,530
So Allah has chosen me from those few people who are a little sensitive.

1327
01:24:39,610 --> 01:24:46,450
So you have also been blessed by Allah. I am very happy. You are fortunate that you have been able to read through your articles.

1328
01:24:46,760 --> 01:24:54,680
You educate people and also give them career counseling.

1329
01:24:54,760 --> 01:24:56,680
So this is a very good thing.

1330
01:24:56,760 --> 01:25:01,441
And the same thing, the one who comes out of the storm,

1331
01:25:01,521 --> 01:25:07,680
he understands the pain and wants others not to fall into that pain.

1332
01:25:07,760 --> 01:25:13,410
Others should not fall into that world pool and I somehow save them.

1333
01:25:13,490 --> 01:25:18,490
I advise them to avoid going from here to there. This is not the right path for a career.

1334
01:25:18,570 --> 01:25:27,990
You need a big heart for this because in today's world, we are materialistic people.

1335
01:25:28,070 --> 01:25:31,370
We try to collect everything ourselves and leave the rest to the hell.

1336
01:25:31,450 --> 01:25:35,030
So this is your big heart and this is your good intentions and this is the reason.

1337
01:25:35,110 --> 01:25:38,870
See, this is not your heart. You will always be like this.

1338
01:25:38,950 --> 01:25:40,880
This is why you will also face difficulties.

1339
01:25:40,960 --> 01:25:48,040
